WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:11.420
The Republic of China is holding its first national athletic meet here today, and although

00:11.420 --> 00:15.400
they have modern races and other events, it's one of the first-time sports of the Chinese

00:15.400 --> 00:17.560
people that proved most popular.

00:17.560 --> 00:20.560
The fame of Chinese archers goes back thousands of years.

00:20.560 --> 00:25.480
There's a record crowd out, including many Chinese flappers, to see the archers bend

00:25.480 --> 00:26.480
a mean bow.

00:26.480 --> 00:28.000
Keep your eye on the target.

00:28.000 --> 00:29.000
Watch it now.

00:29.000 --> 00:30.000
Smacko!

00:30.000 --> 00:31.280
A bullseye.

00:31.280 --> 00:36.560
One of the ancient games that takes the crowd is the pastime known as kicking the shuttlecock.

00:36.560 --> 00:40.360
If you don't think it takes skill to do that, just try it with a baby's ball.

00:40.360 --> 00:43.560
The athletic meet today commemorates the founding of the republic.

00:43.560 --> 00:48.240
It's being held in Nanking's new million-dollar stadium, and boy, they're getting a million

00:48.240 --> 01:03.360
dollars worth of fun out of it, and I don't mean maybe.

